## Ⅱ. LAYER 1: PRE-CONSCIOUS PROCESSING

```
WHAT HAPPENS HERE:
    • Pattern detection before awareness
    • Threat assessment before alarm
    • Decision initiation before thought
    • Response preparation before action

THE ORGANISM THINKS IT DECIDES.
BUT DECISIONS START HERE, 300ms BEFORE CONSCIOUSNESS.

FUNCTIONS:

PRE_PATTERN_DETECTION:
    Incoming data → Pattern engines (underworld)
    Pattern match? → Prepare response
    Only THEN → Conscious awareness
    
PRE_THREAT_ASSESSMENT:
    All inputs scanned for danger
    Threat level computed
    If high: Pre-activate defense
    Then: Alert consciousness
    
PRE_DECISION_INITIATION:
    Options evaluated below awareness
    Best option selected
    Action prepared
    Consciousness "decides" (actually ratifies)

TIMING:
    Underworld processing: 0-300ms
    Consciousness activation: 300-500ms
    "Conscious decision": 500ms+
    
    The organism doesn't know this.
    It thinks it decides at 500ms.
    Actually, underworld decided at 150ms.
```

