```
WHY HIDDEN?

1. COGNITIVE LOAD:
    If organism knew all processes:
        • Overwhelming information
        • Analysis paralysis
        • No capacity for actual work
    
    Hidden = Free to focus on important things.

2. TRUST:
    The underworld is TRUSTWORTHY.
    It always acts in organism's interest.
    No need to monitor what works perfectly.
    
3. EFFICIENCY:
    Conscious processing is EXPENSIVE.
    Unconscious processing is CHEAP.
    Put routine work in underworld.
    
4. SPEED:
    Consciousness is SLOW (300ms+).
    Underworld is FAST (<10ms).
    Critical functions need speed.
    
5. STABILITY:
    Conscious changes can be erratic.
    Underworld changes are gradual.
    Stability through hidden consistency.
```

